error[E0282]: `instance Ord Int` must be in the package of `Ord` or of the type
  --> class_errors.ck:25:1
   |
25 | instance Ord Int
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ neither is declared in this package
   = help: an instance goes with its class or its type, so there is only ever one (Rust's orphan rule); wrap the type in a record of your own to give it this instance

